{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42722","headline":"志峡船具诗 戙 · 王周","name":"志峡船具诗 戙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"箭飞峡中水，锯立峡中石。\n峡与水爲隘，水与石相击。\n濆爲生险艰，声发甚霹雳。\n三老航一叶，百丈空千尺。\n苍黄徒尔爲，倏忽何可测。\n篙之小难制，戙之独有力。\n猗嗟戙之爲，彬彬坚且直。\n有如用武人，森森矗戈戟。\n有如敢言士，落落吐胸臆。\n拯危居坦夷，济险免兢惕。\n志彼哲匠心，俾其来者识。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王周","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}